9effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小妇别诗 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"一身狼狈踰冬秋，姊妹人人叹白头。\n刚得在家三日好，明朝行李又杭州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45390,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小妇别诗 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"轻寒轻热养花天，个日钱塘更可怜。\n骢马欲嘶嘶不得，白公堤畔柳如鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45391,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小妇别诗 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"涌金门外柳条丝，岳有新祠白有碑。\n一句叮咛君记取，西陵莫作小苏诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45392,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初至西湖 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"山上清波水上尘，钱时花月宋时春。\n看官不识杭州语，只道相逢有北人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45393,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初至西湖 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"一络香风十里堤，万株杨柳著行齐。\n苏州浪得佳名字，试把湖山共品题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45394,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上迟陶石篑戏题 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"兰舟系处一骢嘶，个是桃蹊个柳蹊。\n山色湖光判断尽，只留花草待标题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45395,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上迟陶石篑戏题 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"歌舞丛中可度身，六桥随处嗅香尘。\n西家有个如花女，可得将来有远人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45396,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上赠钱塘汤令 其一","author":"袁宏道","text":"一帘秋色一堂云，白石滩头坐使君。\n套取桃花为押字，判来山水作移文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45397,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上赠钱塘汤令 其二","author":"袁宏道","text":"著意怜花紧护持，不曾残杀一枝枝。\n花神欲谢廉明宰，分付袁郎好作诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45398,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上赠钱塘汤令 其三","author":"袁宏道","text":"罗绮如烟粉作丘，青娥国里小诸侯。\n河阳不敢谈花事，只是天堂见亦羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45399,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上赠钱塘汤令 其四","author":"袁宏道","text":"一个穷官不解为，贪他绛叶与青枝。\n来时开花去结子，教人怎不骂狂痴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45400,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遍虚","author":"袁宏道","text":"剃却颠毛剩却身，衲衣袍帽不沾尘。\n告君古佛无多子，著了边旁亦是人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45401,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪梦末句迟之德州诗","author":"袁宏道","text":"一尺残膏到晓明，五更霜里万千情。\n依稀梦得迟之句，红映楼台绿映城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45402,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花初月夜","author":"袁宏道","text":"梨花初点贴窗流，斜月笙萧处处楼。\n醉里不知花是影，隔纱惊唤小杨州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":45403,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]